## Note ## 
1. Any functionals or wavefunction-based methods can be replaced with B3LYP. 
   Functionals: LSDA/BP86/M062X/MN15/MN15L/PBE1PBE/TPSSh/PBEPBE/W97XD/CAM-B3LYP/TPSSTPSS/M06/B3PW91
   Wavefunction-based methods: HF/MP2/MP4/CCSD
2. Any basis set can be replaced with 6-31G(d)
   Basis set: 6-31+G*/6-311G+G**/LANL2DZ/SDD/Def2SVP/Def2TZVP/cc-PVDZ/cc-PVTZ/aug-cc-PVTZ
3. Empirical dispersion can be GD3 or GD3BJ.
4. SCRF=(PCM/CPCM/SMD,solvent=solventname) If solvent name not included then SCRF=(PCM/CPCM/SMD,Read) and 
   write EPs=dielectric constant value end of the coordinates after single blank line
